[0.000, "o", "./docs/00-project-overview.md:13:> Test your Agentforce agents by having AI conversations with them.\r\n./docs/00-project-overview.md:17:A Claude Code plugin that lets developers test Salesforce Agentforce agents through AI-driven headless conversations. Users drop a test plan, run a command, and Claude has dozens of conversations with the agent -- testing edge cases, validating guardrails, checking topic routing -- then generates a detailed report of what works and what doesn't.\r\n./docs/00-project-overview.md:24:| Community Agentforce MCP servers (3 repos) | Talk to agents via Agent API | Zero test assertions, no pass/fail, no reporting |\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "./docs/00-project-overview.md:26:| Agentforce Vibes | Code-level testing (Apex, LWC) | Does NOT test agent behavior/conversations |\r\n./docs/00-project-overview.md:36:4. **Regression generation.** After exploratory testing, Claude converts findings into standard `AiEvaluationDefinition` YAML specs for CI/CD.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "./docs/00-project-overview.md:44:| Build | Agentforce Vibes | Generate agent code, scaffold topics/actions |\r\n"]
